            content: "1. **Oddiy yechim.** $120\\cdot1=120$ B.\n2. **O'rta yechim.** $300\\cdot2=600$ B. BOM, metadata va satr oxiri berilmaganligi uchun hisobga olinmaydi.\n3. **Murakkab yechim.** $80\\cdot1+20\\cdot2+5\\cdot4=80+40+20=140$ B. 105 ta ko'rinadigan belgi 105 bayt bo'lishi shart emas.",
