        content: "$i$ bit rang chuqurligi $2^i$ rang holatini beradi. 1 bit – 2 rang, 8 bit – 256, 24 bit – taxminan 16.7 million. 32 bit ko'pincha 24 bit rang + 8 bit alfa shaffoflik.",
