            content: "1. **Oddiy yechim.** $1024\\cdot768\\cdot8/8=786\\,432$ B = 768 KiB.\n2. **O'rta yechim.** Xom: $44\\,100\\cdot16\\cdot2\\cdot90/8=15\\,876\\,000$ B. Siqilgan: $5\\,292\\,000$ B $\\approx5.05$ MiB.\n3. **Murakkab yechim.** Umumiy bitrate 4.628 Mbit/s. 1800 s fayl: $4.628\\cdot10^6\\cdot1800/8=1\\,041\\,300\\,000$ B. 2 GiB = $2\\cdot2^{30}=2\\,147\\,483\\,648$ B. $\\lfloor2\\,147\\,483\\,648/1\\,041\\,300\\,000\\rfloor=2$ fayl.",
